<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.6 bln - Oct 29.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.6 bln - Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Tuesday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.599 billion as of October 29, from $3.565 billion on October 23.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Oct 29    Oct 23    Oct '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.599     3.565     2.873</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.157     1.158     1.556</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.755     4.723     4.429</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
